OL,3,GNEWSAHospice site featured in Ted
OL,4,ALasso's new season
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Berkshire hospice took centre stage
OL,7,Fin hit show Ted Lasso after an unused
OL,8,Fwing was transformed into a film set.
OL,10,FThames Hospice's Otter Wing in
OL,11,FMaidenhead was used by the cast and
OL,12,Fcrew of the Emmy-winning programme,
OL,13,Fwhich follows the fortunes of the
OL,14,Ffictional AFC Richmond, when filming
OL,15,Ftook place last September.
OL,17,FChief executive Rachael de Caux said
OL,18,Fhiring out the space is an important
OL,19,Frevenue stream for the hospice, which
OL,20,Fneeds #44,000 a day to provide its
OL,21,Fservices.
OL,23,APub: 31-AugQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
